{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03500","headline":"泥谿 · 王勃","name":"泥谿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弭櫂凌奔壑，低鞭蹑峻岐。\n江涛出岸险，峰磴入云危。\n溜急船文乱，岩斜骑影移。\n水烟笼翠渚，山照落丹崖。\n风生苹浦叶，露泣竹潭枝。\n泛水虽云美，劳歌谁复知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}